OL,5,G0350 Long Lost Family
OL,6,     FJayne's late mother retreated from
OL,7,     Ffamily festivities annually in
OL,8,     FNovember, and she later found out
OL,9,     Fwhy. When her mum was 20 and
OL,10,     Funmarried, she'd had a son who was
OL,11,     Fplaced for adoption. Jayne
OL,12,     Fattempts to find her older
OL,13,     Fbrother. The team also meets
OL,14,     FKevin, who had a baby girl with
OL,15,     Fhis late wife when they were
OL,16,     Fteenagers. They were forced to put
OL,17,     Fher up for adoption, and now he is
OL,18,     Fdetermined to find his eldest
OL,19,     Fdaughter
